===Verb===
{{en-verb}}

# To [[furnish]] with galaxies.
#* {{quote-journal|en|year=1836|author=anonymous|title=The Victim Bride: A Tale of Monadnock|journal=The Philadelphia Visiter|volume=1|issue=14|page=53|passage={{...}} how he struggled at one time like a desperate man fiercly {{sic}} grappling with his mortal foe, and at another like a sanguine lover and noble minded youth, as the cliffy rocks impeded his progress, or dimmed the view he had caught of an aperture, through which the '''galaxied''' firmament was seen in its purity and holiness glowing with diamonds and saphires; {{...}}}}
#* {{quote-text|en|year=1838|author=w:John Edmund Reade|title=Italy: a poem, in six parts|page=138|passage=In dazzling light expands the mighty Dome: / Mirror of Heaven,—but Heaven when she doth wear / All '''galaxied''' with Stars her flashing hair!}}
#* {{quote-text|en|year=2018|author=Adrian G. R. Scott|chapter=A Canticle to Creatureliness|title=A Night Sea Journey|passage=To be dwarfed in a '''galaxied''' sky, / doming, arcing, and revolving over / The little space I briefly occupy.}}
# {{lb|en|archaic}} To [[gather]] [[together]] into a [[luminous]] [[whole]].
#* {{RQ:Mather Magnalia Christi|book=III|chapter=I|chaptername=Remains of the First Classis|section=4th part (Remains: Or, Shorter Accounts of Sundry Divines,{{nb...|Useful in the Churches of New-England.}})|page=213|column=1|passage=Let all their Vertues then be '''''Galaxied''''' into this one Indiſtinct Luſtre, they vvere Faithful Servants of Chriſt, and ''Sufferers'' for their being ſo.}}
#* {{quote-journal|en|year=1841|author=w:Edgar Allan Poe|title=Review of New Books|journal=Graham’s Magazine|volume=18|issue=5|page=249|passage=The brilliancies on one page of Lalla Roohk {{sic}} would have sufficed to establish that very reputation which has been in a great measure self-dimned by the '''galaxied''' lustre of the entire book.}}
#* {{quote-text|en|year=1844|author=Horace Smith|title=Arthur Arundel: A Tale of the English Revolution|volume=1|page=172|passage=How dazzling must their brightness be when they are '''galaxied''' in a single bosom!}}

