{{root|yi|ine-pro|*sekʷ-|id=say}}
From  {{inh|yi|gmh|sagen}}, from {{inh|yi|goh|sagēn}}, from {{inh|yi|gmw-pro|*saggjan}}, from {{inh|yi|gem-pro|*sagjaną}}, from {{inh|yi|ine-pro||*sokʷ-h₁-yé-}}, from a derivative of {{m|ine-pro|*sekʷ-||to say}}. Compare {{cog|nl|zeggen}}, {{cog|de|sagen}}, {{cog|bar|sogn}}, {{cog|en|say}}, {{cog|fy|sizze}}.

