* Georgian: {{t|ka|აგნოსტიკური}}
* German: {{t+|de|agnostisch}}, {{t+|de|skeptisch}}
* Hindi: {{t+|hi|अज्ञेयवादी|tr=ajñeyvādī}}
* Ido: {{t+|io|agnostika}}
* Indonesian: {{t+|id|agnostik}}
* Irish: {{t|ga|agnóisíoch}}
