* Norwegian:
*: Bokmål: {{t+|nb|agnostisk}}
*: Nynorsk: {{t|nn|agnostisk}}
* Polish: {{t+|pl|agnostyczny|m}}, {{t+|pl|agnostycystyczny}}
* Portuguese: {{t+|pt|agnóstico}}
* Russian: {{t+|ru|агности́ческий}}
* Serbo-Croatian:
*: Cyrillic: {{t|sh|агно̀стичкӣ}}
*: Roman: {{t+|sh|agnòstičkī}}
