===Etymology===
From {{inh|non|gem-pro|*fadēr|t=father}}, from {{inh|non|ine-pro|*ph₂tḗr|t=father}}. Cognate with {{cog|ang|fæder}}, {{cog|ofs|feder}}, {{cog|osx|fadar}}, {{cog|goh|fater}}, {{cog|got|𐍆𐌰𐌳𐌰𐍂}}.

