===Noun===
{{non-noun|m|fǫður|feðr}}

# [[father]]
#* {{quote-book|non|year=c. 1230|year_published=1911 (1925)|author=w:Snorri Sturluson|chapter=Haraldz saga ins hárfagra|trans-chapter=Saga of Harald Fairhair|title=Heimskringla|editor=Finnur Jónsson|location=Copenhagen|publisher=G. E. C. Gads forlag
|text=Haraldr tók konungdom eptir '''fǫður''' sinn.|translation=Harald took the kingdom after his '''father'''.}}
#* ''10th c.'' inscription on the Runestone of Harald Bluetooth, one of the [[w:Jelling stones|Jelling stones]].
#*: {{quote|non|ᚼᛅᚱᛅᛚᛏᚱ ᛬ ᚴᚢᚾᚢᚴᛦ ᛬ ᛒᛅᚦ ᛬ ᚴᛅᚢᚱᚢᛅ / ᚴᚢᛒᛚ ᛬ ᚦᛅᚢᛋᛁ ᛬ ᛅᚠᛏ ᛬ ᚴᚢᚱᛘ '''ᚠᛅᚦᚢᚱ''' ᛋᛁᚾ|tr=haraltr : kunukR : baþ : kaurua / kubl : þausi : aft : kurm '''faþur''' sin|King Haraldr ordered this monument made in memory of Gormr, his '''father'''.}}

