The second element is from {{m|de|Burg}}; the first element is usually said to be of {{der|de|sla|-}} origin, possibly related to the root of the Czech city name {{m|cs|Brno}}.<ref>Vlasto, A. P. (1970). The Entry of the Slavs Into Christendom: An Introduction to the Medieval History of the Slavs. United Kingdom: Cambridge University Press, p. 352</ref>

