Page 87 North Rhine-Westphalia: -------- begin text --------
==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
From {{compound|en|North Rhine|Westphalia}}. The Allied occupation authorities created the state in 1947 by joining the northern half of the [[Prussian]] {{w|Rhine Province}} to the province of Westphalia (as well as the small {{w|Free State of Lippe}}).

===Proper noun===
{{en-proper noun|head=[[north|North]] [[Rhine]]-[[Westphalia]]}}

