Page 89 city state: -------- begin text --------
==English==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|en|city-state}}

===Etymology===
From {{com|en|city|state}}, a {{calque|en|de|Stadtstaat|nocap=1}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A [[sovereign]] [[city]], as in [[Ancient Greece]], often part of a [[league]] of such cities.
#: {{ux|en|Singapore is the world's most populous '''city state''' and the only [[island]] '''city-state''' in the world.}}
#: {{ux|en|The [[Vatican City]] State, a [[sovereign]] '''city-state''', has a large number of [[embassy|embassies]] across the world.}}

