==Hebrew==

===Etymology===
Compare {{cog|uga|𐎛𐎐}} and {{cog|ar|إِنْ}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|he|/(ʔ)en/|a=IL}}
* {{audio|he|LL-Q9288 (heb)-YaronSh-אין.wav}}

===Particle===
{{he-part|wv=אֵין|tr=en}}

# [[there be|There is]] not, there are not: {{non-gloss|used in expressing non-existence in the present tense}}.
#: {{ux|he|'''אין''' אפשרות אחרת?|tr='''en''' efsharút akhéret?|'''Is there no''' other option?|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|he|'''אין''' מקום בשביל זה.|tr='''en''' makóm bishvíl zé.|'''There's no''' room [''or'' not enough room] for it.|inline=1}}
#* Popular {{w|Piyyut}} of unknown authorship:
#*: {{quote|he|'''אֵין''' אַדִּיר כַּאדֹנָי / '''וְאֵין''' בָּרוּךְ כְּבֶן עַמְרָם / '''אֵין''' גְּדוֹלָה כַּתּוֹרָה / '''וְאֵין''' דּוֹרְשָׁהּ כְּיִשְׂרָאֵל|tr='''en''' adír kadonáy / '''v'én''' barúkh k'vén amrám / '''én''' g'dolá katorá / '''v'én''' dor'shá k'yisra'él|'''There is no one''' powerful like the Lord / '''And there is no one''' blessed like the son of Amram / '''There is nothing''' great like the Torah / '''And there is no one''' professing it like Israel.}}
# {{non-gloss|Used in expressing non-possession in the present tense.}}
#: {{ux|he|'''אין''' לנו כרטיסים.|tr='''en''' lánu kartisím.|We don't have tickets. [''literally'' '''There are not''' to us tickets.]|inline=1}}
## {{lb|he|colloquial}} {{non-gloss|With a definite object.}}
##: {{ux|he|'''אין''' לנו את הכרטיסים.|tr='''en''' lánu et hakartisím.|We don't have the tickets.|inline=1}}
# {{lb|he|dated|or|formal}} [[not|Not]], [[be|is]] not, are not: {{non-gloss|a negative present-tense copula}}.
## {{non-gloss|Used uninflected, preceding the subject.}}
##* {{ante|10 {{B.C.E.}}}}, [[w:Hillel the Elder|Hillel the Elder]], quoted in [[w:Pirkei Avot|Pirkei Avot]] 1:14:
##*: {{quote|he|הוּא הָיָה אוֹמֵר אִם '''אֵין''' אֲנִי לִי. מִי לִי. וּכְשֶׁאֲנִי לְעַצְמִי. מָה אֲנִי. וְאִם לֹא עַכְשָׁיו. אֵימָתָי:|tr=hu hayá omér im '''en''' aní li, mí li, ukh'she'aní l'atsmí, má aní, v'ím lo akhsháv, ematáy.|He [Hillel] used to say, “If I '''am not''' for me, who is for me? And when I am for myself, what am I? And if not now, when?”}}
##* '''1742''', [[w:Chaim ibn Attar|Chaim ibn Attar]], {{l|he||אור החיים|tr=or hakhayím}}, to [[Numbers]] 26:54, reprinted in, 1872, {{lang|he|חמשה חומשי תורה}}, volume 4, Zhytomyr, &nbsp;[http://google.com/books?id=oH4tAAAAYAAJ&pg=RA2-PT386]:
##*: {{quote|he|לאלה תחלק הארץ שהם באי הארץ ועדיין '''אין''' אני יודע אם דוקא להבאים לכלל עשרים או לכלל באי הארץ ואפי׳ לאותם שלא הגיעו לכלל עשרים|"To these shall the land be divided", which are those who enter the land; but I still '''am not''' knowing if specifically to those who have entered the sum [age] of twenty or to the totality of those who enter the land, even those who have not reached the sum [age] of twenty
}}
## {{non-gloss|With incorporated personal pronoun, preceding the predicate.}}
##* '''1994''', Yoram Taharlev ({{lang|he|[[w:he:יורם טהרלב|יורם טהרלב]]}}, lyricist), [[w:Dana International|Dana International]] (singer), “{{lang|he|ישנן בנות}}” (''yeshnán banót'', “Some Girls”, song), in Dana International, “{{lang|he|אומפטמפה}}” (Umpatampa, album):
##*: {{quote|he|אבל אני '''איני''' כזאת \ אבל אני '''איני, איני''' כזאת \ עם מי שאין לי בטחון \ אנ'לא יוצאת גם לירקון.|tr=avál aní '''ení''' kazót / avál aní '''ení, ení''' kazót / im mi she'én li bitakhón / anló yotsét gam layarkón.|But I '''am not''' like that / but I '''am not, am not''' like that / with someone I don't have security with / I don't even go to [[w:Hayarkon Street|Hayarkon]].}}

====Inflection====
{{he-prep-inflection
|base={{l|he|אֵין|tr=en}}
|1s={{l|he|אֵינֶנִּי|tr=enéni}},<br/>{{l|he|אֵינִי|tr=ení}}
|2ms={{l|he|אֵינְךָ|tr=enkhá}}
|2fs={{l|he|אֵינֵךְ|tr=enékh}}
|3ms={{l|he|אֵינֶנּוּ|tr=enénu}},<br/>{{l|he|אֵינוֹ|tr=enó}}
|3fs={{l|he|ּאֵינֶנָּה|tr=enéna}},<br/>{{l|he|אֵינָהּ|tr=ená}}
|1p={{l|he|אֵינֶנּוּ|tr=enénu}}
|2mp={{l|he|אֵינְכֶם|tr=enkhém}}
|2fp={{l|he|אֵינְכֶן|tr=enkhén}}
|3mp={{l|he|אֵינָם|tr=enám}}
|3fp={{l|he|אֵינָן|tr=enán}}
}}

====Synonyms====
* {{sense|there is not}} {{l|he||[[לא|לֹא]] [[היה|הָיָה]]|tr=lo hayá}} {{qualifier|verb}}
* {{sense|expressing non-possession}} {{l|he||[[לא|לֹא]] [[היה|הָיָה]]|tr=lo hayá}} {{qualifier|verb}}
* {{sense|not}} {{l|he|לֹא|tr=ló}} {{qualifier|adverb}}, {{l|he||[[לא|לֹא]] [[היה|הָיָה]]|tr=lo hayá}} {{qualifier|verb}}

====Antonyms====
