==Proto-Germanic==

===Etymology===
From {{der|gem-pro|ine-pro|*bʰeh₂ǵos||beech}}. The Indo-European root is also the source of {{cog|grc|φηγός||oak}} and  {{cog|la|fāgus||beech}}.

The origin of the senses in {{cog|got|-}} ({{m-g|book, writing}}) are unclear—see more at {{l|gem-pro|*bōks}}—but they may be transferred from that word by conflation.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|gem-pro|/ˈbɔː.kɔː/}}

