=={{tl|nonlemma}}==
Please read the explanation for this template. It's not necessary on the inflected form pages you've created. [[User:Ultimateria|Ultimateria]] ([[User talk:Ultimateria|talk]]) 23:05, 29 October 2024 (UTC)

== [[:Category:Pages using duplicate arguments in template calls]] ==

Please check this category for problems with your recent Icelandic {{template|rhymes}} edits. —[[User:Fish bowl|Fish bowl]] ([[User talk:Fish bowl|talk]]) 21:11, 17 November 2024 (UTC)

== Creating Icelandic rhymes pages ==

Hi there! Thanks for your Icelandic rhymes contributions. 
* Please don't forget to place the {{tl|rhymes nav}} template at the top of every rhymes page you create. This ensures the page is placed in the appropriate categories. Look at any rhymes page for an example. At an absolute minimum, {{tl|rhymes nav|is}} needs to be specified, but you can add other parameters too, using other rhymes pages as a model to guide you.
* I would like to discourage you from using the {{tl|col4}} template on Rhymes pages. Four columns is too few when you are providing a gloss. Please consider using {{tl|col2}} or {{tl|col3}} - or the standard using {{tl|rhyme list begin}} and {{tl|rhyme list end}} which you can see in action at [[Rhymes:French/jɛ̃]], for instance.
Please don't hesitate to ask me if you have questions. Thanks! [[User:This, that and the other|This, that and the other]] ([[User talk:This, that and the other|talk]]) 09:24, 2 December 2024 (UTC)
-------- end text --------
