Page 152 Rhymes:Icelandic/ast: -------- begin text --------
{{rhymes nav|is|a|st}}

==Rhymes==

===One syllable===

{{col4|is
|'''bast'''<t:to fasten ''something'' with a string”; “to fix ''something''”; “to put a bandage on a wound (''in set phrases'')”; “to be limited ''to a certain area'' (''in set phrases'')”; “to decide amongst yourselves (''in set phrases'')”; “a rope made of vegetable fibers>
|'''brast'''<t:to succumb ''or break after being worn down''”; “to lack ''something''”; “to burst into tears (''in set phrases'')>
|'''dast'''<t:to fall over ''after losing one's balance''”; “to think (''in set phrases'')>
|'''fast'''<t:unmoving”, “unchanging”; “forcefully (''learned'')>
|'''flast'''<t:to make a {{l|en|fillet}} ''of fish''”; “to flatten ''with a rolling pin'' (''in set phrases'')>
|'''gast'''<t:to be capable ''of something''”; “may, could, ''or'' might ''as the former of a polite request''”; “to guess ''something''”; “to tell ''or'' report on ''something''”; “to birth ''a child''”; “an ability”; “a hypothesis>
|'''hast'''<t:uncomfortable ''of horses or cars''”; “sloppy ''of speech''”; “accelerated>
|'''hrast'''<t:to push ''something'' over”; “to open something violently”; “to push ''a boat out to see''”; “to set ''something'' into motion”; “to direct ''something'' away”; “to repel ''an attack''>
|'''kast'''<t:that which has been thrown”; “a sudden outburst of emotion”; “a deviation from a regular movement ''e.g. a jerk on a bike''>
|'''Kast'''
|'''last'''<t:to read”; “to advise ''someone'' not to do ''something''”; “to pick ''something from something'' (''dated'')”; “to move slowly (''in set phrases'')”; “slander>
|'''mast'''<t:to determine ''or'' estimate the price of ''something''>
|'''past'''<t:a pasture”; “nourishment>
|'''sast'''<t:to sit”; “to be present”; “to be in power”; “to have a seat”; “to fit well ''of clothes''>
|'''vast'''<t:to wring ''a liquid from something''”; “to wind ''a rope''”; “to unfurl ''a sail''”; “to wave”; “to happen”; “a wheel on which wire is wound”; “an ocean>
}}

===Five syllables===

{{col4|is
|'''forsögulegast'''<t:most prehistoric>
}}
