Page 205 steinn: -------- begin text --------
{{also|Steinn}}
==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|is|non|steinn||stone}}, from {{inh|is|gmq-pro|ᛊᛏᚨᛁᚾᚨᛉ}}, from {{inh|is|gem-pro|*stainaz||stone}}. Cognate with {{cog|en|stone}}, {{cog|de|Stein}}, {{cog|nl|steen}}, {{cog|da|sten}}, {{cog|nb|sten}}, {{cog|nn|stein}}, {{cog|sv|sten}}, {{cog|fo|steinur}}, {{cog|fy|stien}}, {{cog|nds|Steen}}. Ultimately from {{der|is|ine-pro|*steyh₂-||something hard}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|is|/steitn/}}
*: {{rhymes|is|eitn|s=1}}

===Noun===
{{is-noun|m}}

# [[stone]], [[rock]]
# [[stone]], [[pit]], [[pip]] {{gloss|the seed of certain [[fruit]]}}
# {{lb|is|medicine}} a [[calculus]], a [[stone]]

====Declension====
{{is-ndecl|m}}

====Derived terms====
{{rel-top|Terms derived from {{m|is|steinn||stone}}}}
* {{l|is|augasteinn||eyeball}}
* {{l|is|brennisteinn||brimstone, sulfur}}
* {{l|is|eðalsteinn||gemstone, jewel}}
* {{l|is|gimsteinn||gemstone, jewel}}
* {{l|is|hrapsteinn||shooting star}}
* {{l|is|loftsteinn||meteorite}}
* {{l|is|segulsteinn||lodestone}}
* {{l|is|steingeit||ibex, Capricorn}}
* {{l|is|þungsteinn||tungsten}}
* {{l|is|á milli steins og sleggju||between the anvil and the sledge-hammer}}
* {{l|is|fara í steininn||to go to jail}}
* {{l|is|setjast í helgan stein||to retire}}
* {{l|is|þegja eins og steinn||silent as the grave}}
{{rel-bottom}}

{{rel-top|Terms derived from {{m|is|steinn||calculus}}}}
* {{l|is|blóðsteinn||blood calculus}}
* {{l|is|blöðrusteinn||vesical calculus, cystolith}}
* {{l|is|brissteinn||pancreatic calculus, pancreolith}}
* {{l|is|eyrnasteinn||aural calculus}}
* {{l|is|gallsteinn||biliary calculus}}
* {{l|is|garnasteinn||intestinal calculus, enterolith, alvinolith}}
* {{l|is|hvekksteinn||prostatic calculus, prostatolith}}
* {{l|is|kóralsteinn||coral calculus, dendrite calculus, staghorn calculus}}
* {{l|is|lifrarsteinn||hepatic calculus}}
* {{l|is|munnvatnssteinn||salivary calculus, ptyalith, ptyalolith, sialolith}}
* {{l|is|nefholssteinn||nasal calculus, rhinolite}}
* {{l|is|nýrasteinn||renal calculus, kidney stone, nephrolith}}
* {{l|is|tannsteinn||dental calculus, odontolith, tartar}}
* {{l|is|trefjasteinn||fibrinous calculus}}
* {{l|is|þvagfærasteinn||urinary calculus}}
* {{l|is|þvagrásarsteinn||urethral calculus, calculus urethralis}}
* {{l|is|þvagsteinn||urinary calculus}}
