From {{inh|is|non|hann}}, from {{inh|is|gmq-pro|*hānaʀ}}, of uncertain origin.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|is|/ˈhanː/|a=stressed}}
*: {{rhymes|is|anː|s=1}}
*: {{rfap|is||is|inline=yes}}
* {{IPA|is|/an(ː)/|a=unstressed}}

===Pronoun===
{{head|is|pronoun|cat2=personal pronouns|cat3=pronoun forms}}

# {{sense|personal pronoun}} [[he]]
#: {{ux|is|'''Hann''' [[vera|er]] [[gamall]].|'''He''' [[is]] [[old]].}}
#: {{ux|is|'''Hann''' [[drepa|drap]] [[hann]].|'''He''' [[killed]] [[him]].}}
# {{sense|personal pronoun}} accusative singular form of the word {{m|is|hann}} (meaning "[[he]]") meaning "[[him]]".
#: {{ux|is|[[hann|Hann]] [[drepa|drap]] '''hann'''.|[[he|He]] [[killed]] '''him'''.}}
#: {{ux|is|[[hætta|Hættu]] þessu! Ég [[elska]] '''hann'''!|[[stop|Stop]] it! I [[love]] '''him'''!}}

