Indo-European cognates: {{cog|sa|तनोति|tr=tanóti}}, {{cog|el|τείνω}}, {{cog|la|teneō}}, {{m|la|tendō}}, {{cog|cy|tant||string of a musical instrument}}, {{cog|br|ardant}}, {{cog|ru|тенёто}}, {{cog|lt|tìnti}}.

